Package: clink
Version: 1.0.7
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: chriz-3656 <chriz-3656@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6, libxkbcommon-x11-0
Recommends: adb
Description: Android-powered drawing tablet and desktop annotation system
 Clink turns Android devices into wireless or USB drawing tablets and desktop
 annotation canvases with real-time transparent overlays and input injection.
 Includes high-performance native compiled GUI companion.
